   "stem": {
      "text": "A particle moves along the curve \\( x e^{y} = 2 \\) so that its coordinates \\( x \\) and \\( y \\) are differentiable functions of time \\( t \\). At the instant the particle is at the point \\( (2, 0) \\), \\( \\frac{dx}{dt} = 4 \\) units per second. Find \\( \\frac{dy}{dt} \\), in units per second, at that instant."
   },
