   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Differentiate both sides of \\( x e^{y} = 2 \\) with respect to \\( t \\), using the product rule on the term that contains both variables: \\( \\left(e^{y}\\right)\\frac{dx}{dt} + \\left(x e^{y}\\right)\\frac{dy}{dt} = 0 \\).",
