         "text": "At \\( (2, 0) \\) the coefficient of \\( \\frac{dx}{dt} \\) is \\( 1 \\) and the coefficient of \\( \\frac{dy}{dt} \\) is \\( 2 \\). Substitute \\( \\frac{dx}{dt} = 4 \\): \\( (1)(4) + (2)\\frac{dy}{dt} = 0 \\).",
         "mathjson": 4
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Solve for the requested rate: \\( \\frac{dy}{dt} = -2 \\).",
